--[[
FOLK VALLEY [RUN] - weapon builder (generated by tools/gen_rig.py)

1. In Studio: File > Import 3D > choose FolkValley_Weapons.fbx > Import.
   Default import settings are fine ("Merge Meshes" must stay off).
2. View > Command Bar: paste ALL of this file and press Enter.

It builds a Folder "Weapons" in ServerStorage (named "Weapons (new)" if one is
already there) with one Model per weapon, named by its Id:
  * PrimaryPart "Handle": 0.4 x 0.4 x 0.4 Part, Transparency 1, at the grip
  * every visible part is a MeshPart named for what it is, welded to the Handle
    with a WeldConstraint; Anchored/CanCollide/CanTouch/CanQuery false, Massless true
  * number attributes "Top" and "Bottom" (studs above / below the Handle along Y)
  * an Attachment "Fx" under the Handle for Epic, Legendary, Limited and Mythic weapons
The imported model is cleaned up afterwards. Ctrl+Z undoes the whole thing.
3. Right-click the folder > Save to File... to get the .rbxm, or move it to
   wherever the game keeps its weapons.
]]

